  "thesis": "A complete-day bullish directional-movement state filtered by strong ADX may distinguish persistent BTC trends from weak noisy moves early enough that a causal next-open long/cash policy preserves material upside while reducing adverse paths and improving fee-adjusted risk-adjusted performance over full-capital buy-and-hold.",
  "economic_rationale": "The mechanism requires directional high expansion to dominate directional low expansion while their true-range-normalized separation is persistently strong. It is useful only if DMI14 and ADX14 above 25 retain material after-cost upside, lower drawdown, improve Calmar, survive annual breadth and remain stable at the frozen 20 and 30 threshold neighbors. Reduced exposure alone cannot pass.",
  "opportunity_cost": "Test one executable high-low directional-strength mechanism before allocating more research to another close-only trend rule, external data or waiting-only forward families.",
